  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat (400°F/200°C).",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together orange juice, lemon juice, garlic, honey, and Dijon mustard.",
    "Brush salmon fillets with olive oil and brush with glaze on both sides.",
    "Season salmon with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Grill salmon for 4-5 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Warm tortillas by wrapping them in foil and heating them on the grill for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Assemble wraps by placing a piece of grilled salmon on each tortilla.",
    "Top with mixed greens, chopped parsley, and a squeeze of lemon juice.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
